    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/98f4558f4398c49451ab184cb3cfd0d4.avif?t=1729017436\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729017436\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729017436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729017436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A game with cute kittens specially created for you to relax, be inspired and have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/5553570f7b355e434a16b4060ddafd41.poster.avif?t=1729017436\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/5553570f7b355e434a16b4060ddafd41.webm?t=1729017436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Be amazed by the minimalist style and beautiful art of this game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/97c41e24b1effe34230827d9a04a5248.avif?t=1729017436\" /></div><br><br>So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving a puzzle the complete art will be released, so at any time you can have fun again solving the entire puzzle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/bd0c36296692c7bf2c5e4ae92e4de053.poster.avif?t=1729017436\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629600/extras/bd0c36296692c7bf2c5e4ae92e4de053.webm?t=1729017436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Relax with these cute puzzles and forget about your worries by watching our feline friends!",
